/E (Prof. Carlos Pereira Santos is Professor of Applied Data Science and Artificial Intelligence at Breda University of Applied Sciences \(BUas\), the Netherlands. His research focuses on data-driven real-time systems, applied AI, game engine technology, and distributed computing. Alongside his technical work, he shapes the university's AI policy, infrastructure, and laboratory strategy, and leads applied AI research initiatives.)
