<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (After a decade leading the Cradle research team, I developed a research identity that bridges industry practice and academic rigour. My work spans embodied AI, serious games, virtual production, and extended realities, always grounded in real-world deployment and societal relevance. None of this has been achieved alone; every milestone reflects the collective effort of the researchers, students, and industry partners I have had the privilege of working with.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
209 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (I am seeking a part-time role at TU/e as a deliberate bridge between an applied and a research university. My goal is to strengthen the connection between both institutions, anchoring joint research while bringing applied implementation expertise, lab infrastructure, and industry networks. I aim to allocate my time as follows: Research \(30%\), Education \(20%\), Impact \(20%\), Team & Leadership \(30%\).)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
