/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (BUas operates within a Project-Based Learning model where students engage with real-world challenges across integrative blocks. My role as an educator goes beyond teaching, it involves designing the conditions in which meaningful learning can happen.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
