228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (I have been involved in the design and development of several programmes within the Academy for AI, Games and Media: the Bachelor in Applied Data Science and Artificial Intelligence, the Master in Game Technology, and the forthcoming Master in Physical AI. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (This work includes curriculum architecture, Intended Learning Outcomes definition, directly linking European projects \(VPSN, AVENUE, VPSN2\) to educational programme , and the development of lab facilities, including the AI Makerspace, XR Stage Lab, Motion Capture Studio, and Photogrammetry Studio that connects research with practice. Alongside this, I have built sustained relationships with industry partners, ensuring that the challenges students work on are shaped by real professional contexts.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
