231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (I believe Europe needs stronger innovation pathways where practitioners with deep industry knowledge can apply research methods to solve real problems. Universities of Applied Sciences are uniquely positioned to build these pathways, but only if education and research are genuinely mutually reinforcing: student projects feed into research questions, research outputs feed back into educational design, and industry partners co-shape both.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
