/E (I see impact as the natural endpoint of applied research, the moment when a tool, framework, or platform moves beyond the lab and changes how people work, decide, or learn.  My impact spans three domains: industry practice \(tools deployed in professional film and healthcare\), policy and governance \(serious game platforms used by marine planners and government agencies\), and education and society \(AI literacy frameworks and Virtual Productions Community adopted across Europe\).)
